Per-file exception: `data/mbma_naproxen.*`

Everything in this repository is MIT-licensed as above, EXCEPT the files
matching `data/mbma_naproxen.*`. That test fixture is derived from an open
access publication licensed CC BY-NC 4.0 (Boucher M, Bennetts M, CPT:PSP
2018;7:288-297, doi:10.1002/psp4.12299) and carries that licence, not this
one -- so commercial use of those files is not granted. See
`data/mbma_naproxen.LICENSE` for the terms and `data/mbma_naproxen.README.md`
for the provenance. The files are test data only: they are never linked into
the `ferx` binary, and `Cargo.toml` excludes them from the packaged crate, so
the crate published to crates.io is uniformly MIT.
